  Your Plating gains the Armed Quality without occupying a Quality Slot.
text: >
  Combat Plating [Passive]: Your Plating gains the Armed Quality without occupying a Quality Slot.

---

# Nothing of its own to run: the Quality is the Plating's (combat-plating's header).
